menu "svc_report"

    config SVC_REPORT_STREAM_MAX_S
        int "Close the audio stream by itself after this many seconds"
        depends on NET_STREAM_ENABLE
        range 10 7200
        default 600
        help
            Ten minutes unless opened again (KEHOACH 7.5). test_apps/capture
            raises it for its 30-minute sessions.

    config SVC_REPORT_STREAM_BUFFER_KB
        int "Size of sb_stream in PSRAM (KB)"
        depends on NET_STREAM_ENABLE
        range 16 4096
        default 512
        help
            About 5 s of mode 5 and 8 s of mode 2: enough to ride out the
            stalls of the link to the host measured on board B (KEHOACH 5.3).
            app_wiring of main and test_apps/capture both create it this size.

endmenu
